<h3 class="summary-heading">viewer</h3>
<p>This viewer allows you to view repositories entirely client-side. Objects are fetched as needed and stored in IndexedDB, similar to how <code>git</code> normally works.<br>The <a href="https://git.legoktm.com/public/webgit.git/">source code</a> is available (<code>0123abcd</code>).</p>
